 "Vous soutiendriez tous les deux l'autre sans compter si l'argent manquait.": "You would both support each other without counting the cost if money were short.",
 "Pour vous, soutenir sans compter, à quoi cela ressemblerait-il au quotidien ?": "For you, what would supporting without counting the cost look like day to day?",
