 "Au fil de cette année, comment aimeriez-vous découvrir le quotidien de l'autre ?": "Over the course of that year, how would you like to discover the other person's everyday life?",
 "Pour vous deux, l'engagement viendra quand les conditions seront mûres.": "For you both, commitment will come when the time is right.",
 "Quelles conditions rendraient le moment mûr, très concrètement ?": "In very practical terms, what conditions would make the time right?",
